{"id":"u10","level":"A1","emoji":"⚽","title":{"t":"Freizeit","s":"Free time","a":"audio/de-en/42b8fe32929a.mp3"},"goals":["Talk about your hobbies","Say what you can and can't do: Ich kann schwimmen.","Say what you like doing with gern","Ask and answer yes/no questions"],"words":[{"id":"w01","t":"die Freizeit","s":"free time","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"In der Freizeit lese ich.","s":"In my free time I read.","a":"audio/de-en/0427447baa14.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/a8e84e841833.mp3"},{"id":"w02","t":"das Hobby","pl":"die Hobbys","s":"hobby","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Mein Hobby ist Fußball.","s":"My hobby is soccer.","a":"audio/de-en/9b8ea9d515d2.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/3c648082ad36.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/bdd48d89cd77.mp3"},{"id":"w03","t":"schwimmen","s":"to swim","emoji":"🏊","ex":{"t":"Im Sommer schwimmen wir.","s":"In summer we swim.","a":"audio/de-en/6f4ed72786ae.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f3ca.svg","a":"audio/de-en/40157395bcd9.mp3"},{"id":"w04","t":"lesen","s":"to read","emoji":"📖","ex":{"t":"Maryam liest am Abend.","s":"Maryam reads in the evening.","a":"audio/de-en/47c8c1607980.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f4d6.svg","a":"audio/de-en/6d2a9ef34c1d.mp3"},{"id":"w05","t":"spielen","s":"to play","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Die Kinder spielen im Park.","s":"The children are playing in the park.","a":"audio/de-en/93c7c625b050.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/cefd1992d991.mp3"},{"id":"w06","t":"der Fußball","pl":"die Fußbälle","s":"soccer; soccer ball","emoji":"⚽","ex":{"t":"Ali spielt Fußball.","s":"Ali plays soccer.","a":"audio/de-en/cdbaf6cacb9a.mp3"},"img":"img/e/26bd.svg","a":"audio/de-en/0af638463dec.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/e976a8cdd18e.mp3"},{"id":"w07","t":"die Musik","s":"music","emoji":"🎵","ex":{"t":"Ich mag Musik.","s":"I like music.","a":"audio/de-en/4ea8d01a37ff.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f3b5.svg","a":"audio/de-en/d1d4d1eefcd2.mp3"},{"id":"w08","t":"hören","s":"to hear; to listen to","emoji":"🎧","ex":{"t":"Wir hören Musik.","s":"We listen to music.","a":"audio/de-en/fc7f145edd70.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f3a7.svg","a":"audio/de-en/996035874152.mp3"},{"id":"w09","t":"kochen","s":"to cook","emoji":"🍲","ex":{"t":"Reza kocht sehr gut.","s":"Reza cooks very well.","a":"audio/de-en/27c1a10ab3c5.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f372.svg","a":"audio/de-en/143e472dd080.mp3"},{"id":"w10","t":"singen","s":"to sing","emoji":"🎤","ex":{"t":"Sara singt am Morgen.","s":"Sara sings in the morning.","a":"audio/de-en/343e85dab8d1.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f3a4.svg","a":"audio/de-en/41568f8b8e89.mp3"},{"id":"w11","t":"Rad fahren","s":"to ride a bike","emoji":"🚲","ex":{"t":"Im Sommer fahre ich Rad.","s":"In summer I ride my bike.","a":"audio/de-en/15df7f96ab58.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f6b2.svg","a":"audio/de-en/de917102cda8.mp3"},{"id":"w12","t":"wandern","s":"to hike","emoji":"🥾","ex":{"t":"Im Herbst wandern wir.","s":"In the fall we go hiking.","a":"audio/de-en/c5df8a363579.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f97e.svg","a":"audio/de-en/503cb6487ae7.mp3"},{"id":"w13","t":"gern","s":"gladly; verb + gern = to like doing something","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Ich koche gern.","s":"I like cooking.","a":"audio/de-en/a0aee8f1e4ea.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/680e4bbbc7bc.mp3"},{"id":"w14","t":"können","s":"can; to be able to","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Ich kann schwimmen.","s":"I can swim.","a":"audio/de-en/1d8612ef5963.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/f743f76e148f.mp3"}],"phrases":[{"id":"p01","t":"Was machst du in der Freizeit?","s":"What do you do in your free time?","a":"audio/de-en/a97565b74212.mp3"},{"id":"p02","t":"Ich spiele gern Fußball.","s":"I like playing soccer.","a":"audio/de-en/9434b9082603.mp3"},{"id":"p03","t":"Ich kann gut kochen.","s":"I can cook well.","a":"audio/de-en/747bbe478449.mp3"},{"id":"p04","t":"Ich kann nicht singen.","s":"I can't sing.","a":"audio/de-en/1ae094b7bdc9.mp3"},{"id":"p05","t":"Kannst du schwimmen?","s":"Can you swim?","a":"audio/de-en/73f38f70b622.mp3"},{"id":"p06","t":"Ja, natürlich!","s":"Yes, of course!","a":"audio/de-en/70faff21a871.mp3"},{"id":"p07","t":"Nein, leider nicht.","s":"No, unfortunately not.","a":"audio/de-en/f4414663f7a7.mp3"},{"id":"p08","t":"Hast du heute Abend Zeit?","s":"Are you free this evening?","a":"audio/de-en/26f6d25ed976.mp3"}],"dialogue":{"title":{"t":"Was machst du gern?","s":"What do you like doing?","a":"audio/de-en/de97104fcefc.mp3"},"speakers":{"A":{"name":"Lukas","voice":"m"},"B":{"name":"Mina","voice":"f"}},"lines":[{"sp":"A","t":"Mina, was machst du in der Freizeit?","s":"Mina, what do you do in your free time?","a":"audio/de-en/863b244bb105.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Ich lese gern und ich koche gern. Und du?","s":"I like reading and I like cooking. And you?","a":"audio/de-en/312c1506ea31.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Ich spiele gern Fußball. Spielst du auch Fußball?","s":"I like playing soccer. Do you play soccer too?","a":"audio/de-en/c54b12ff7480.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Nein, leider nicht. Aber ich kann gut schwimmen.","s":"No, unfortunately not. But I can swim well.","a":"audio/de-en/f91d9e912fba.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Super! Ich kann nicht so gut schwimmen.","s":"Great! I can't swim very well.","a":"audio/de-en/d50c9e953b06.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Hast du heute Abend Zeit? Wir können zusammen schwimmen!","s":"Are you free this evening? We can swim together!","a":"audio/de-en/6ed70497e3b0.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Ja, gern! Um wie viel Uhr?","s":"Yes, I'd love to! At what time?","a":"audio/de-en/a577a3ae56b7.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Um sieben Uhr. Tschüss, Lukas!","s":"At seven o'clock. Bye, Lukas!","a":"audio/de-en/79d9d7a35305.mp3"}]},"grammar":[{"id":"g01","title":{"t":"Ich kann schwimmen.","s":"können (can) + verb at the end"},"explain":"**können** means *can*. It's a little irregular: **ich kann** and **er/sie kann** have no ending.\nThe second verb goes to the **end** of the sentence in its basic form (the infinitive): **Ich kann gut schwimmen.** / **Maryam kann nicht Rad fahren.**\nThis is a typical German pattern: **kann** in position 2, the infinitive at the very end.\n**möchten** works the same way: **Ich möchte Fußball spielen.**","table":[["ich","kann"],["du","kannst"],["er / sie / es","kann"],["wir","können"],["ihr","könnt"],["sie / Sie","können"]],"examples":[{"t":"Ich kann schwimmen.","s":"I can swim.","a":"audio/de-en/1d8612ef5963.mp3"},{"t":"Reza kann gut Fußball spielen.","s":"Reza can play soccer well.","a":"audio/de-en/714defea076f.mp3"},{"t":"Sara kann nicht Rad fahren.","s":"Sara can't ride a bike.","a":"audio/de-en/efec334f807f.mp3"},{"t":"Ich möchte am Abend lesen.","s":"I'd like to read in the evening.","a":"audio/de-en/df674d336e2a.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"Ich ___ schwimmen.","options":["kannst","kann","können"],"answer":1,"s":"I can swim.","full":"Ich kann schwimmen.","a":"audio/de-en/1d8612ef5963.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Du ___ gut kochen.","options":["kann","könnt","kannst"],"answer":2,"s":"You can cook well.","full":"Du kannst gut kochen.","a":"audio/de-en/4b9d7944f3c3.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Wir können Fußball ___.","options":["spielen","spielt","spiele"],"answer":0,"s":"We can play soccer.","full":"Wir können Fußball spielen.","a":"audio/de-en/75af3af3f9fd.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Maryam ___ gut singen.","answer":["kann"],"s":"Maryam can sing well.","full":"Maryam kann gut singen.","a":"audio/de-en/fa33bc671739.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Lukas kann gut Rad ___.","answer":["fahren"],"s":"Lukas can ride a bike well.","full":"Lukas kann gut Rad fahren.","a":"audio/de-en/5717588d4b9a.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Ich kann gut kochen.","s":"I can cook well.","full":"Ich kann gut kochen.","a":"audio/de-en/747bbe478449.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Ali kann nicht schwimmen.","s":"Ali can't swim.","full":"Ali kann nicht schwimmen.","a":"audio/de-en/8951582e6bb2.mp3"}]},{"id":"g02","title":{"t":"Spielst du gern Fußball?","s":"gern & yes/no questions"},"explain":"To say you **like doing** something, put **gern** after the verb: **Ich spiele gern Fußball.** (I like playing soccer.) The opposite is **nicht gern**: **Ich koche nicht gern.**\nFor a **yes/no question**, put the verb **first**: Du spielst gern Fußball. → **Spielst du gern Fußball?** With **können**, only **kann** moves to the front: **Kannst du schwimmen?**\nAnswer with **Ja, …** or **Nein, …**\nNote: **lesen** and **fahren** change their vowel: **du liest, er liest**; **du fährst, er fährt**.","table":[["Du schwimmst gern.","Schwimmst du gern?"],["Sie kocht gern.","Kocht sie gern?"],["Du kannst singen.","Kannst du singen?"]],"examples":[{"t":"Ich lese gern.","s":"I like reading.","a":"audio/de-en/d4ff2ab1d274.mp3"},{"t":"Maryam hört gern Musik.","s":"Maryam likes listening to music.","a":"audio/de-en/c248a908219b.mp3"},{"t":"Spielst du gern Fußball? – Ja!","s":"Do you like playing soccer? – Yes!","a":"audio/de-en/5094d41cb279.mp3"},{"t":"Kann Ali kochen? – Nein, leider nicht.","s":"Can Ali cook? – No, unfortunately not.","a":"audio/de-en/27c30c5ef08c.mp3"},{"t":"Wanderst du gern? – Nein, ich wandere nicht gern.","s":"Do you like hiking? – No, I don't like hiking.","a":"audio/de-en/2272c3f73f90.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"___ du gern Musik?","options":["Hört","Hörst","Höre"],"answer":1,"s":"Do you like listening to music?","full":"Hörst du gern Musik?","a":"audio/de-en/d378c8621895.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Ich koche ___.","options":["können","Hobby","gern"],"answer":2,"s":"I like cooking.","full":"Ich koche gern.","a":"audio/de-en/a0aee8f1e4ea.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"___ du schwimmen? – Ja, ich kann schwimmen.","answer":["Kannst"],"s":"Can you swim? – Yes, I can swim.","full":"Kannst du schwimmen? – Ja, ich kann schwimmen.","a":"audio/de-en/fab28d913cf6.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Liest Sara gern? – Nein, sie liest ___ gern.","options":["nicht","kein","keine"],"answer":0,"s":"Does Sara like reading? – No, she doesn't like reading.","full":"Liest Sara gern? – Nein, sie liest nicht gern.","a":"audio/de-en/dbb9c9b29be8.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Ich ___ gern Musik.","answer":["höre","hoere"],"s":"I like listening to music.","full":"Ich höre gern Musik.","a":"audio/de-en/9882fad73df4.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Spielst du gern Fußball?","s":"Do you like playing soccer?","full":"Spielst du gern Fußball?","a":"audio/de-en/ce8de7e5d3a6.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Wandern Sie gern?","s":"Do you like hiking?","full":"Wandern Sie gern?","a":"audio/de-en/ad128c01dd2f.mp3"}]}],"reading":{"title":{"t":"Familie Ahmadi in der Freizeit","s":"The Ahmadi family in their free time","a":"audio/de-en/93d51d8119c0.mp3"},"text":[{"t":"Familie Ahmadi wohnt in Köln.","s":"The Ahmadi family lives in Cologne.","a":"audio/de-en/2f3c57abfbcf.mp3"},{"t":"Ali spielt gern Fußball. Er spielt jeden Tag im Park.","s":"Ali likes playing soccer. He plays in the park every day.","a":"audio/de-en/9c812d79e994.mp3"},{"t":"Maryam liest gern und sie hört gern Musik.","s":"Maryam likes reading and she likes listening to music.","a":"audio/de-en/1d0be1153e97.mp3"},{"t":"Mina kann sehr gut singen.","s":"Mina can sing very well.","a":"audio/de-en/1b308ddd343a.mp3"},{"t":"Amir kann nicht schwimmen, aber er kann gut kochen.","s":"Amir can't swim, but he can cook well.","a":"audio/de-en/8f2be4449f4d.mp3"},{"t":"Im Sommer wandert die Familie gern.","s":"In summer the family likes to go hiking.","a":"audio/de-en/3358d4a63c09.mp3"},{"t":"Im Winter kochen sie am Abend gern zusammen.","s":"In winter they like cooking together in the evening.","a":"audio/de-en/7a4a30d38ff3.mp3"}],"questions":[{"q":{"t":"Wo spielt Ali Fußball?","s":"Where does Ali play soccer?","a":"audio/de-en/11d0ab9a1c76.mp3"},"options":["in der Schule","im Park","im Supermarkt"],"answer":1},{"q":{"t":"Was macht Maryam gern?","s":"What does Maryam like doing?","a":"audio/de-en/576e55d2becb.mp3"},"options":["Sie liest und hört Musik.","Sie kocht.","Sie spielt Fußball."],"answer":0},{"q":{"t":"Kann Amir schwimmen?","s":"Can Amir swim?","a":"audio/de-en/371c3d58a329.mp3"},"options":["Ja, sehr gut.","Ja, im Sommer.","Nein, aber er kann gut kochen."],"answer":2},{"q":{"t":"Was macht die Familie im Sommer?","s":"What does the family do in summer?","a":"audio/de-en/1e21520a318c.mp3"},"options":["Sie sieht fern.","Sie wandert.","Sie schwimmt."],"answer":1}]},"sentences":[{"t":"Ich höre gern Musik.","s":"I like listening to music.","a":"audio/de-en/9882fad73df4.mp3"},{"t":"Kannst du Rad fahren?","s":"Can you ride a bike?","a":"audio/de-en/d48f2015d664.mp3"},{"t":"Mein Hobby ist Kochen.","s":"My hobby is cooking.","a":"audio/de-en/3a41a4e06cd9.mp3"},{"t":"Wir spielen am Abend Fußball.","s":"We play soccer in the evening.","a":"audio/de-en/c96e96cb8f64.mp3"},{"t":"Sara kann gut singen.","s":"Sara can sing well.","a":"audio/de-en/3bc5806598d6.mp3"},{"t":"Lesen Sie gern?","s":"Do you like reading?","a":"audio/de-en/07c865b724d8.mp3"},{"t":"Nein, ich kann nicht schwimmen.","s":"No, I can't swim.","a":"audio/de-en/ed13cf3760e1.mp3"},{"t":"Hast du heute Abend Zeit?","s":"Are you free this evening?","a":"audio/de-en/26f6d25ed976.mp3"}],"img":"img/e/26bd.svg"}